{"id":"locale/LC_ALL","module":"locale","qualname":"LC_ALL","name":"LC_ALL","kind":"data","parent":null,"signatures":[],"doc":"Combination of all locale settings. If this flag is used when the locale is changed, setting the locale for all categories is attempted. If that fails for any category, no category is changed at all. When the locale is retrieved using this flag, a string indicating the setting for all categories is returned. This string can be later used to restore the settings.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/locale.html#locale.LC_ALL","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"locale/LC_COLLATE","module":"locale","qualname":"LC_COLLATE","name":"LC_COLLATE","kind":"data","parent":null,"signatures":[],"doc":"Locale category for sorting strings. The functions strcoll() and strxfrm() of the locale module are affected.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/locale.html#locale.LC_COLLATE","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"locale/LC_CTYPE","module":"locale","qualname":"LC_CTYPE","name":"LC_CTYPE","kind":"data","parent":null,"signatures":[],"doc":"Locale category for the character type functions. Most importantly, this category defines the text encoding, i.e. how bytes are interpreted as Unicode codepoints. See PEP 538 and PEP 540 for how this variable might be automatically coerced to C.UTF-8 to avoid issues created by invalid settings in containers or incompatible settings passed over remote SSH connections.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/locale.html#locale.LC_CTYPE","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"locale/LC_MESSAGES","module":"locale","qualname":"LC_MESSAGES","name":"LC_MESSAGES","kind":"data","parent":null,"signatures":[],"doc":"Locale category for message display. Python currently does not support application specific locale-aware messages. Messages displayed by the operating system, like those returned by os.strerror() might be affected by this category.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/locale.html#locale.LC_MESSAGES","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"locale/LC_MONETARY","module":"locale","qualname":"LC_MONETARY","name":"LC_MONETARY","kind":"data","parent":null,"signatures":[],"doc":"Locale category for formatting of monetary values. The available options are available from the localeconv() function.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/locale.html#locale.LC_MONETARY","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"locale/LC_NUMERIC","module":"locale","qualname":"LC_NUMERIC","name":"LC_NUMERIC","kind":"data","parent":null,"signatures":[],"doc":"Locale category for formatting numbers. The functions format_string(), atoi(), atof() and str() of the locale module are affected by that category. All other numeric formatting operations are not affected.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/locale.html#locale.LC_NUMERIC","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"locale/LC_TIME","module":"locale","qualname":"LC_TIME","name":"LC_TIME","kind":"data","parent":null,"signatures":[],"doc":"Locale category for the formatting of time. The function time.strftime() follows these conventions.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/locale.html#locale.LC_TIME","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":null,"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
